  "method": "Per calendar month: plain linear mean and sample std across every included observation (occupancy: zeros included; ADR: booked months only), moment-matched to a lognormal (cv = std/mean, median = mean/sqrt(1+cv^2)). sigma_log = sqrt(ln(1+cv^2)) is year-to-year variation; level_sigma_log = sigma_log/sqrt(n) is persistent. One observation -> pooled cv. predictive_sigma combines both; predictive_median = mean x exp(-predictive_sigma^2/2) keeps the mean equal to the sources' average. Bands are year-1 predictive.",
